WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:06.730
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.910
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.510
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:23.050
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:25.050
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.460
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.020
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:35.630
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:38.330
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.100
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:49.480
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.740
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:56.120
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:59.880
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:03.030
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:06.960
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.770
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.000
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.300
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:22.830
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:07.890
Vacuous Missile!!!

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:18.200
Take that!

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:29.710
Saemi... Mom...

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.510
What have I done?!

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:04.570
Say, Apollo 11 will finally land
on the moon the day after tomorrow.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.410
I can hardly wait!

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:10.650
Say, do you think
there's life on the moon?

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.380
I don't really expect them to
find rabbits up there, but...

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.020
...Ukiya? Mr. Fukuoka was an invader...

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.650
...from the very beginning.
Don't let it bother you.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:24.700
That has nothing to do with it.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:27.230
No!
Please stop it!

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.960
What's wrong with it, cuties?!

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.430
Come on, do something nasty with us!

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:34.100
NO way!
<i>'</i> GO away!

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:35.970
We wanna touch your big titties!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.770
Hey, it's lsogai and Takanashi!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:43.150
Ukiya!

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.650
Right.

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:52.520
What is it?!

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.850
Ukiya!
I know!

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.130
If you can't do it, I will!

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:00.170
Shut up! I'm just about to!!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.170
Forget it! I'm going!

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.200
Stop that!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.570
Who said that?!
Where are you?!

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:15.680
Who the hell are you?!
You got a problem, moron?!

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:19.620
I don't care if trash of
society such as yourselves...

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.350
...run amok and exterminate
each other! However...

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:25.920
...l will not allow you to
trouble good, honest people!!

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.150
Don't talk nonsense at us!

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.830
When I'm done with you,
you'll never speak again!!

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:33.870
Leave them to me.
Go, now, quickly!

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.830
Right!
Thank you so much!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.370
Now, come on!!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:59.850
He's all mouth!
He was just posing!

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:01.720
What a loser!

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:08.290
Are you okay?!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.070
Can you stand?
Y..Yeah...

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.340
I'm so sorry!
I'm sorry...

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:18.410
Don't sweat it.
When I see people like that...

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:20.240
...l can't help but interfere.

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:23.280
It's our fault you got hurt...
Thank you so much!

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:24.880
Come on, Ukiya, lend a hand!

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:26.540
Huh?

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:30.820
Oh, no! lf you were
watching from over there...

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.330
...l wish you had
helped me fight them.

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:38.130
Pretend to be tough all you want,
but it's pointless without results.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:41.630
Hey! Do you have any
right to say that to him?!

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:47.240
I was... I...

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.970
No, he's right.
Results are all that matters.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.580
I wanted to protect these girls...

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:59.920
...and they were unharmed.
What more could I ask?

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:03.620
That's not what I meant!!
That's not what I meant.

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:08.630
If you really want to protect someone,
you have to crush the bad guys...

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:12.930
...or else you never know when
they'll strike again. That's why I...

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.960
Ukiya...

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.090
Dammit!

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:20.500
Ukiya?! I'm Sorry!
Wait up!

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:22.460
Ukiya!

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:31.850
So, you are saying the person known
as Yasutaka Fukuoka does not exist?

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:34.850
Yes, sir. I went through
his entire personal history.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.720
However, he was in
the family register.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:41.280
He also had a residence card,
a university diploma...

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:44.700
...and all the required
papers for a teacher.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:49.900
Which means he was suddenly
born into society as a teacher...

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.940
...without experiencing childhood.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.290
Top Secret Data

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:13.660
Top Secret Data Family register, residence
card, diploma, teaching license...

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:16.490
...he couldn't have done
all that on his own.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:20.660
Commander... the invaders are
intigrated beyond our imaginations...

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:25.600
Yes. We need to tighten up secrecy.

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:26.850
Yes, sir.

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:29.180
Ms. Ochiai, what is your report?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:34.510
Here, sir. I asked the students
for their opinion of Mr. Fukuoka...

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:38.180
...and there is one common
opinion as you mentioned.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.520
Their opinion of him...

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:43.520
To put it simply,
they say... Well...

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.460
That he was an unpleasant man.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.620
Er, yes. Something
along those lines.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.430
Commander, did you already notice that?

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.070
Yes...

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:56.830
Did you hear about Mr. Fukuoka?

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.840
Not me.
He quit teaching, right?

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:02.470
A girl from Class-B told me.
They say he quit for family reasons.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.100
Who cares, anyway?
Yeah! He was a real jerk.

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:07.370
Now the favoritism will stop!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:18.220
Stand. Bow.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:19.850
Sit.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:23.890
Don't start relaxing just
because it's almost summer vacation.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:27.460
Although you shouldn't relax too
much even during summer vacation.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.830
Before homeroom, I will
introduce a transfer student.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.700
Come in!
Yes, sir!

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:44.310
Pleased to meet you.
l am Reiji Kageyama.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.250
I am glad to make
your acquaintance.

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:51.760
Before he came to this school,
Reiji Kageyama lived overseas.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:59.130
Aya! ls this Kageyama
really that wonderful?

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:04.470
Instead of wonderful, I would call
him incredibly kind and polite...

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:07.770
It's like he's ready to tackle
any kind of study or sports.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.780
And?
Huh?

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.640
What do you think
of him, lkusawa?

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:14.200
What do you mean?

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:18.280
You know! ls he
cooler than Ukiya?!

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.910
Oh, please! Why are
you mentioning Ukiya?

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:25.930
And besides, Ukiya's no good.
He's been really sloppy recently.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:29.690
Is the teacher invader
thing still bothering him?

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:35.500
Yeah, I think so. But he Is the
captain, so he has to act like one.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:39.630
But I understand how he feels.

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:40.940
That's true...

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:45.910
That's true. What if the bad guy
was someone you know really well?

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.380
That's true...

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.850
Well, yes, they
appear to be human...

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:54.920
...but they are the invader's
lifeless combat machines.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:10:00.020
Still, for all that, Mr. Fukuoka was the
only person who acknowledged my existence.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.690
Kurogane...

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:06.220
I liked Mr. Fukuoka.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:09.500
But... then why did you
join the Gate Keepers?

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:16.740
You're in the class committee, the
top of the class, pretty, wealthy...

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:19.910
I didn't want you to get
any further ahead of me.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.680
What do you think, Reiko?

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.350
That's true...

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:29.910
Reiko...?!

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.080
That's true...

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.870
Let's go, c'mon!
Don't drag your feet!

00:10:46.070 --> 00:10:48.100
Maybe I should take up a sport.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.500
Hi.
How long have you been there?

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:57.480
You're Shun Ukiya, right?
I've been looking all over for you.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.160
It sure is hot around here.
Duh, it's summer.

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:18.700
Oh, yeah. I forgot you
used to live overseas.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.740
No, I was talking about you.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:25.740
You have a fire... Yes... Hotter
than the magma under the earth...

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.610
...hotter than the sun
scorching the sky!

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.980
I was wondering what
you were gonna say...

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:32.990
...but that's stupid. Bye.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.850
At this very moment, you are
beginning to lose sight of yourselfl

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:38.780
What?!

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:43.160
You said this morning that
bad guys must be crushed.

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:44.320
So what?

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.390
However, now you are confused!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:50.270
You are losing faith in your own
convictions. Tell me I'm wrong.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.440
I'm not confused!

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:55.500
As for myself, I always see my
beliefs through, no matter what!

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:58.940
You couldn't even dodge the
wimpy punches of those punks!

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:01.810
You must not hesitate! It will
produce the one worst result!!

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:03.080
Enough! Stop it!

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:04.780
If you really do have
something you want to protect...!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:05.440
Stop it!!

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.850
No matter what
sacrifice that entails...!

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.250
Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!!!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.850
Are you afraid to get
blood on your hands?!

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:13.480
I'm telling you to STOP IT!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.030
I'm sorry. I think l said too much.

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.460
Bye.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.440
Those reflexes...

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:34.540
He let himself get beaten
up this morning on purpose?!

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:39.450
<i>Excuse me, this is a bulletin fiom the
staff room to all special committee members.</i>

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:44.290
<i>Special committee members are to assemble
at their designated areas immediately</i>

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:46.480
<i>I repeat...</i>

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:48.550
<i>This is a bulletin from the staff' room.</i>

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:53.070
<i>Special committee members are to assemble
at their designated areas immediately</i>

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:06.540
Where is Captain Ukiya?

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.170
Sorry, I'm late.

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.840
Good grief. What kept you?!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.110
Who cares?

00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:15.850
Don't talk to me like that.
You're the captain, aren't you?!

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.980
Never mind that.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.720
I'm sorry, sir.

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:21.950
Have a look at this. A group of
invaders appeared without warning...

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:25.830
...and infiltrated an oil refinery
in the Kawasaki district.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:30.360
In the event of the refinery's destruction,
I will display the projected damaged areas.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.810
It extends all the
way to my house...

00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:42.040
Commander! Let me assume
command for this mission!

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.950
Ukiya is mentally
unstable right now!

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:47.920
He cannot fulfill the
responsibility of captain!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.610
No, I'll do it!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:50.520
But...

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:53.820
I will crush every
last one of theml!

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:55.650
Commander!
Commander!

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:01.260
I am leaving this in
Captain Ukiya's hands.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.860
Commander...

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:08.160
Stop the invaders advance,
and protect the complex!

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.170
Head out, Gate Keepers!

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:13.170
Roger, AEGIS!

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.130
Ooh, intense!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.690
Even more intense!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.640
Honestly, does he
have to go so fast?!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.200
He's probably worried
about his family.

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:42.620
That's understandable, but a leader
can't go off doing his own thing.

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:45.680
Ukiya...

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:46.900
Commander...

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.850
It is a path that cannot be avoided
in the fight against the invaders.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:53.650
Everyone will have to overcome it
with their own wills.

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.860
What?! This bus is split
right down the middle!

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.460
There you are. Let's go!

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.060
GATE...

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:21.310
I have to crush the bad guys!

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:25.550
GATE OPEN!!

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:33.080
Let's do it!
Vacuous Miss...

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:46.670
Fuse into command form.

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:50.440
Hold it right there!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.470
Oil?

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.590
Who's there?!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.520
A pathetic maggot like you
who can't even wave a stick...

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:09.360
...in the face of the enemy
doesn't deserve to hear my name.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.520
What?!

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.530
The Gate Keepers, huh?

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:16.970
I had some expectations,
but is this all you can do?

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:19.970
I've seen enough. Kill him!

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:40.390
Huh...? What's this?

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:55.470
I knew l had more
talent than lkusawa.

00:16:57.980 --> 00:17:00.140
GATE OPEN!

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:06.080
Dash and Kick!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:10.160
Arrow of Light!

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.750
Explosive Panda Fire Ball!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:19.500
We did it, senior!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.990
So, the maggots have arrived!

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:26.870
Who are you calling a maggot?!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.910
Nothing's left but that invader.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.310
Yeah. I'll take him...!

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:34.510
You are afraid, aren't you?

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:35.510
Like hell I'm afraid!

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:39.020
You're lying!! Even
if it looks human...

00:17:39.090 --> 00:17:41.350
...that is just a war machine!!

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.750
GATE OPEN!

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:52.790
A black gate?!

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.490
It can't be! Then is that...?!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.940
A human.
Ayaya...

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.970
I don't believe it.

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:02.640
Shadow Edge!

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:11.380
What's wrong? Did you believe you were
the only ones who could open gates?

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:17.950
Just as you are affiliated with AEGIS,
l am affiliated with the invaders.

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:19.990
I am an evil gate keeper.

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:23.360
Now, come on. Kill me!

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:27.160
Kill me, a gate keeper...
a human like yourselves!

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:33.170
I doubt you can. You maggots
aren't prepared to do such a thing.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.810
But l am.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.370
Aside from myself, all humans
are nothing but maggots!!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:44.350
The same as ants on
the side of the road!

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:45.980
What?!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.250
I'll burn you all clean away!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:51.690
You filthy little maggots!

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:53.390
Not so fastl!

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.120
Ukiya...

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.860
Captain, you can't kill people.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:02.370
I don't care whether
he's human or invader!

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:04.400
There are some things
I will not tolerate!

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.370
You can't shoot me.

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:11.430
Yes, I can! I will not let anyone
who places no value on human life...

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.280
...get away with it!

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.120
Vacuous...

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:21.480
...MISSlLE!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:43.200
I'm looking forward
to our next encounter!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:47.240
I'm looking forward to having
you put a big hole in my chest!

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:54.380
Ukiya...

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.020
I wasn't able to defeat him.

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.860
I guess I really am
a failure as captain.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:06.690
No. Our duty is to
protect everyone's lives.

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:11.900
I think you fulfilled your
duty as captain perfectly well.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.170
Rurippe...

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:19.180
I didn't realize it
until now, but you...

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.080
R- Rurippe, what are you...?!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.510
I didn't realize until now...

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:29.420
...that you've started
calling me Rurippe again!!

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.960
Ow!

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.590
Is this the mouth that
calls me Rurippe?! Eh?!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.290
Forgive me!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.790
You got hurt?

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.270
As usual, I couldn't help but
tell off some delinquents...

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.710
...doing naughty things,
and this is what happened.

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:49.900
You poor thing...

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:54.040
Aw, but if it means protecting delicate
females like you girls, I can handle it.

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:02.750
Hi! Sorry about upsetting you yesterday!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.260
No, I should apologize.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:13.060
It's wrong to hesitate.
We all have our own ways of doing things...

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:15.590
...but you're right.

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:22.240
Your right hand is injured.

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:24.070
You can use your left.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:34.710
Thanks. You sure are nice, Ukiya.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:58.900
]uly 21st,1969

00:22:06.690 --> 00:22:10.390
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:14.260
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:19.230
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:22.600
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:22.600 --> 00:22:24.740
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:29.910
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:33.250
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:37.880
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:42.750
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:42.820 --> 00:22:47.380
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:54.160
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
